{"id":"cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale","lines":[{"t":0.66,"end":1.884,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(groan)","de":"(stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":1.85,"end":5.786,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"Son of a— (grunt) (punch)","de":"Du Mistkerl— (ächzt) (Schlag)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":5.758,"end":7.126,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(grunting)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":11.08,"end":12.976,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"You have a Sandevistan?!","de":"Du hast ein Sandevistan?!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":13.417,"end":15.505,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"A rudimentary implant.","de":"Ein rudimentäres Implantat.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":15.704,"end":17.792,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"I'm the one you're after, ain't I?","de":"Du bist doch hinter mir her, oder?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":18.057,"end":22.377,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"All the same meat to me. I'll slaughter each and every one of you.","de":"Für mich seid ihr alle nur Fleisch. Ich schlachte jeden Einzelnen von euch ab.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":22.337,"end":24.665,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"Not unless I zero your ass first!","de":"Nicht, wenn ich dich vorher plattmache!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":24.633,"end":25.281,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"(scoff)","de":"(schnaubt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":25.2,"end":26.232,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(vomits)","de":"(übergibt sich)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":28.688,"end":30.68,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Out of suppressants?","de":"Keine Blocker mehr?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":31.266,"end":35.61,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(vomiting)","de":"(übergibt sich)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":33.438,"end":35.694,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Right on schedule.","de":"Genau nach Plan.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":35.923,"end":37.219,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"No, you don't!","de":"Oh nein, das lässt du!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":38.2,"end":38.896,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Hm?","de":"Hm?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":39.492,"end":41.604,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"(grumbling)","de":"(knurrt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":42.089,"end":45.185,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"(exhale) (grunt)","de":"(atmet aus) (ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":45.188,"end":47.492,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"How did you— ah!","de":"Wie hast du— ah!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":49.199,"end":54.143,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"Falco, David's still back there! Please, turn around!","de":"Falco, David ist noch da hinten! Bitte, kehr um!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":54.141,"end":58.485,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"None leave the slaughterhouse! Not alive!","de":"Niemand verlässt den Schlachthof! Nicht lebendig!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":58.82,"end":60.524,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"Get distracted much?","de":"Leicht abzulenken, was?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":61.117,"end":67.477,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"You! Who are you… to challenge me…","de":"Du! Wer bist du schon … dass du mich herausforderst …","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":63.922,"end":65.146,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(scream)","de":"(schreit)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":66.739,"end":67.699,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(groan)","de":"(stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":68.253,"end":72.981,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"When you can't even stand without your anti-grav crutches?","de":"Wo du ohne deine Antigrav-Krücken nicht mal stehen kannst?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":72.133,"end":75.493,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(grunting)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":73.296,"end":76.44,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Ya think you're special 'cause you're strapped?","de":"Glaubst du, du bist was Besonderes, nur weil du aufgerüstet bist?","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":76.34,"end":77.156,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(groan)","de":"(stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":78.851,"end":81.083,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Don't make me laugh!","de":"Dass ich nicht lache!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":83.357,"end":86.765,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"Falco, turn back!","de":"Falco, kehr um!","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":86.854,"end":87.934,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"…no can do…","de":"… geht nicht …","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":88.348,"end":90.292,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"…was David's final request.","de":"… war Davids letzte Bitte.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":90.204,"end":93.804,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"(whimpering)","de":"(wimmert)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":90.861,"end":93.693,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"If I turn around now, he dies for nothin'.","de":"Wenn ich mich jetzt umdrehe, stirbt er umsonst.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":94.224,"end":99.624,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"We already have our reward money… David wants us to split it, you and me.","de":"Wir haben das Kopfgeld schon … David will, dass wir es teilen, du und ich.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":99.703,"end":102.535,"chars":[3],"who":"Lucy","text":"(more whimpering)","de":"(wimmert weiter)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":100.523,"end":102.635,"chars":[1],"who":"Falco","text":"He also told me to tell ya:","de":"Und ich soll dir noch was sagen:","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":102.607,"end":103.975,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(groan)","de":"(stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":103.032,"end":104.112,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"(grunt)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":104.221,"end":107.413,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"Sorry. Wish we could go to the moon together.","de":"Tut mir leid. Ich wünschte, wir könnten zusammen zum Mond.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":112.317,"end":113.733,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"(grunt)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":119.737,"end":121.177,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"(grunt)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":129.153,"end":130.881,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(scream)","de":"(schreit)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":136.05,"end":137.082,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(gasping)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":140.066,"end":149.954,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(laughing)","de":"(lacht)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":149.633,"end":152.513,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"I had some fun after all.","de":"War doch noch ganz unterhaltsam.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/46.mp3"},{"t":152.969,"end":157.049,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"You know, you could prove an interesting construct.","de":"Weißt du, aus dir könnte ein interessantes Konstrukt werden.","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/47.mp3"},{"t":157.233,"end":162.129,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"Whatever, choom, like I give a shit…","de":"Egal, Choom, als ob mich das juckt …","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/48.mp3"},{"t":163.01,"end":164.858,"chars":[2],"who":"Adam Smasher","text":"Oh well…","de":"Na ja …","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/49.mp3"},{"t":166.954,"end":168.682,"chars":[0],"who":"David","text":"(laughing)","de":"(lacht)","orig":"scenes/cyberpunk_edgerunners_finale/lines/50.mp3"}]}